  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - Information and Communication Technology Sector, through International Consulting &amp; Development Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This definitional mission is identifying and evaluating project opportunities in the information and communications technology (ICT) sector in Turkey for USTDA funding consideration. Turkey has experienced consistent growth in this area due to large government investments, strong consumer demand, and robust private sector spending, and thus this sector holds substantial opportunities for U.S. suppliers of goods, services, and technology in the ICT field.</narrative>
  </description>
